<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef prices were firm on mostly moderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice chuck and round cuts were generally higher, while loin cuts firm and rib cuts uneven. Beef trimmings were not established. - USDA</p>
